WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.859 --> 00:00:08.780
One fine day Skunk was playing with his friends.

2
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.662
"Ha! This is a lot of fun!"

3
00:00:13.023 --> 00:00:13.523
he said.

4
00:00:13.863 --> 00:00:15.204
Then he lifted his tail.

5
00:00:15.224 --> 00:00:17.865
"Oops!" "Ew!

6
00:00:18.285 --> 00:00:19.946
What a terrible smell!

7
00:00:20.547 --> 00:00:22.708
Skunk made a bad smell.

8
00:00:23.028 --> 00:00:23.948
Ha-ha!" said Mouse.

9
00:00:25.889 --> 00:00:27.530
"Yes, ew!"

10
00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:28.471
said Rabbit.

11
00:00:28.491 --> 00:00:30.472
"Let's go play with someone else.

12
00:00:31.132 --> 00:00:32.253
Skunk stinks."

13
00:00:33.734 --> 00:00:35.996
The next day Skunk saw Rabbit and Mouse.

14
00:00:36.697 --> 00:00:38.138
Skunk lowered his tail.

15
00:00:38.798 --> 00:00:40.980
He did not want to make a bad smell again.

16
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.902
"Hi, Rabbit!

17
00:00:43.783 --> 00:00:45.524
Don't you want to play with me?"

18
00:00:45.884 --> 00:00:46.585
said Skunk.

19
00:00:47.085 --> 00:00:48.967
"No! Stinky Skunk!"

20
00:00:49.347 --> 00:00:50.028
said Rabbit.

21
00:00:50.048 --> 00:00:52.170
"Let's not play with him.

22
00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:54.932
He smells bad," said Mouse.

23
00:00:56.173 --> 00:00:58.675
Skunk cried and ran to his cave.

24
00:01:00.424 --> 00:01:04.366
"No one wants to play with me."

25
00:01:09.029 --> 00:01:11.050
He did not come out until nighttime.

26
00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:12.751
He was very sad.

27
00:01:13.831 --> 00:01:15.792
One day Skunk was very thirsty.

28
00:01:16.233 --> 00:01:18.274
He left the cave and went to the pond.

29
00:01:18.874 --> 00:01:21.355
He still held his tail very low.

30
00:01:21.375 --> 00:01:25.598
"Oh, there is Rabbit," he said.

31
00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:29.640
"I must be careful not to make a bad smell."

32
00:01:30.736 --> 00:01:32.458
Rabbit ran past the pond.

33
00:01:32.478 --> 00:01:38.983
"Rabbit, please stop for a moment and play with me," said Skunk.

34
00:01:39.563 --> 00:01:42.926
"I will try not to make a bad smell again."

35
00:01:43.707 --> 00:01:45.028
But Rabbit kept running.

36
00:01:45.788 --> 00:01:47.290
Skunk felt very sad.

37
00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:50.552
He had no friends and no one to play with.

38
00:01:53.495 --> 00:01:57.418
He knew he smelled bad, but there was nothing he could do about it.

39
00:01:57.918 --> 00:02:01.725
Several lonely days passed, and Skunk went for a walk.

40
00:02:02.105 --> 00:02:06.507
All of a sudden, Skunk saw that Rabbit was in trouble.

41
00:02:06.527 --> 00:02:07.347
"Oh no!

42
00:02:07.907 --> 00:02:09.708
Bear is chasing Rabbit!"

43
00:02:09.988 --> 00:02:10.668
said Skunk.

44
00:02:11.129 --> 00:02:12.409
"What can I do?

45
00:02:12.429 --> 00:02:18.812
Bear is so big and has such big teeth.

46
00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:21.493
He might eat me too!"

47
00:02:23.093 --> 00:02:24.834
Skunk decided to run away.

48
00:02:25.854 --> 00:02:29.276
Just as Skunk turned around to run, Rabbit saw him.

49
00:02:31.356 --> 00:02:32.857
"Skunk, help me!

50
00:02:33.397 --> 00:02:35.158
Please!" she cried.

51
00:02:36.538 --> 00:02:37.879
"Oh, poor Rabbit!"

52
00:02:38.239 --> 00:02:38.939
thought Skunk.

53
00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:40.740
"What should I do?

54
00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:48.263
Oh! Maybe my bad smell will chase him away."

55
00:02:49.084 --> 00:02:50.684
Skunk went up to Bear.

56
00:02:50.704 --> 00:02:56.346
"Let Rabbit go, or I will make a bad smell!"

57
00:02:56.847 --> 00:02:57.367
he said.

58
00:02:57.387 --> 00:03:00.008
"Ha-ha!" Bear laughed.

59
00:03:00.428 --> 00:03:01.188
"A smell?

60
00:03:01.868 --> 00:03:03.909
You are so funny, little Skunk.

61
00:03:04.289 --> 00:03:06.390
Let me smell your bad smell."

62
00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:09.011
So Skunk lifted his tail.

63
00:03:09.031 --> 00:03:11.371
"Nooo! Ahhh!

64
00:03:11.591 --> 00:03:12.412
Ugh! Ew!"

65
00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:14.792
cried Bear, and he ran away.

66
00:03:15.573 --> 00:03:17.073
Rabbit was so happy!

67
00:03:19.734 --> 00:03:20.954
She hugged Skunk!

68
00:03:23.295 --> 00:03:25.916
"Skunk, your smell saved my life.

69
00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:27.701
Hey, everyone!

70
00:03:27.721 --> 00:03:29.422
Hooray for Skunk!

71
00:03:29.782 --> 00:03:31.443
He saved me from Bear."

72
00:03:31.463 --> 00:03:34.044
"Hooray for Skunk!"

73
00:03:34.364 --> 00:03:35.505
the animals cheered.

74
00:03:36.305 --> 00:03:37.786
Skunk became a hero!

75
00:03:38.386 --> 00:03:40.187
All the animals surrounded Skunk.

76
00:03:41.188 --> 00:03:44.650
"Show us how you scared Bear away," Mouse asked.

77
00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:47.351
"Okay," said Skunk.

78
00:03:47.371 --> 00:03:53.455
"I lifted my tail like this All the animals held their noses.

79
00:03:54.375 --> 00:03:55.656
And then they all laughed.

80
00:03:57.016 --> 00:03:59.680
"Let's go play together," said Rabbit.

81
00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:02.203
"Yes, let's go play!"

82
00:04:02.943 --> 00:04:03.744
said Skunk.

83
00:04:04.605 --> 00:04:09.051
On that day, Skunk realized he was perfect just the way he was.
